{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal scope cleanup failures.** `handlerFuture.handle(... -> null)` erases every cleanup error, so when suspension or retry has already completed `executionFuture`, a `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` thrown while closing scopes is incorrectly converted into PENDING/RETRYING. Await the original handler future, unwrap completion exceptions, rethrow fatal causes, and ignore only ordinary cleanup failures; add suspension and retry regression tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74o_6k","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":225,"observation_digest":"99c32ba75751b93b9d2ff4bdd75267b53345f52e0be3d969d850b750bd31c14b","observation_id":"aro_v1_thbsxj2xkg4txhjp6s65outhwu","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-03T03:19:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_krcjwzvivukssogfxeon2jd46h","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"be3e03cd4843e1289b8ebafb145890c0aab6e439","reviewer":"codex","start_line":225,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_hwrqiyiuerijceudys2vcalqdt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T03:19:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
